---

Source: npm package "iconoir", pinned at exact version 7.12.1 (see
package.json and package-lock.json)
Vendored subset: iconoir.css, containing the seven glyphs smplFrm uses
(spotify, calendar, camera, clock, lock, temperature-high, warning-triangle).
See that file's header for provenance and how to extend it. Each rule is
copied verbatim from the pinned package and
smplfrm/tests/static/test_iconoir_subset_contract.py asserts that the
vendored rules stay byte-identical to it.
